name=Vitals HUD
id=Vitals_HUD
author=kramari
description=Vitals HUD adds a compact survivor status display for Project Zomboid Build 42. It shows health, endurance, fatigue, hunger and thirst at a glance, while additional conditions appear automatically only when active. Core body temperature is always shown using a cold / normal / hot gauge. The HUD automatically hides while hovering vanilla moodles so their tooltips remain readable. The mod is display-only and intentionally does not reveal hidden information such as zombie infection.
modversion=0.4
versionMin=42.0